Original code in this repository is offered under the MIT License
(LICENSES/MIT.txt). Original research data and documentation are offered under
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt).

These grants cover only rights held by the original authors/contributors.
They do not relicense third-party material embedded in, or used to generate,
the files. See docs/PROVENANCE_AND_LICENSES.md for exclusions and attribution.
An aggregate ZIP does not change the licenses of its individual contents.

The corresponding researcher authorized this licensing arrangement during
repository preparation on 13 October 2026. No new claim of sole ownership,
transfer of copyright, or publication/acceptance of the manuscript is made.
